Credits
=======

Art in art/poop.txt is the original piece shipped with poopascii and is covered
by the MIT license in LICENSE (Copyright (c) 2026 gabytz777).

All other files in art/ come from the community ASCII art collection at

    https://github.com/joeky888/ASCII-Art-collection

which does not state a license. The pieces are reproduced here verbatim except
for these mechanical cleanups, applied by the poopascii maintainer:

  * trailing whitespace was stripped from every line
  * leading/trailing blank lines were removed
  * "See ... for more" cross references to other files of that collection were
    removed, since those files are not shipped here
  * lines consisting only of the word "unknown" (a placeholder the original
    collection used for a missing artist name) were removed
  * two stray non-ASCII decorative bytes were replaced with ASCII look-alikes
    (0xb4 -> ' in elephant, 0xa0 -> space in sailboat)

Artist signatures and "From:" attribution lines inside the art were kept as is.

